  "body_html": "<p>Marszałku, twoja Drużyna liczy domyślnie pół tuzina ludzi. Traktuj ich jak stronnika z etykietą <em>grupa</em> . Wszystkie początkowe wartości mogą się w grze zmieniać.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"crew\" data-hp-key=\"crew\" data-label=\"Crew\">\n<h2 id=\"the-crew\">Drużyna</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Maks. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Maks. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Pancerz\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Pancerz</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"crew:damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Obrażenia\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Rzuć na obrażenia\">Obrażenia</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">HP zaczyna się od 6 na osobę; Pancerz od 0; Obrażenia od d6.</p>\n<h3 id=\"tags\">Etykiety</h3>\n<p>Twoja drużyna zaczyna z etykietą <em>grupa</em>, nadaną przez twoje pochodzenie, oraz 2 kolejnymi wedle uznania.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag0\" data-check-id=\"tag0\"> <span><em>łucznicy</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag1\" data-check-id=\"tag1\"> <span><em>wysportowani</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag2\" data-check-id=\"tag2\"> <span><em>dzielni</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag3\" data-check-id=\"tag3\"> <span><em>przebiegli</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag4\" data-check-id=\"tag4\"> <span><em>oddani</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Zaznaczone na start\"> <span><em>grupa</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag6\" data-check-id=\"tag6\"> <span><em>odporni</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag7\" data-check-id=\"tag7\"> <span><em>groźni</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag8\" data-check-id=\"tag8\"> <span><em>spostrzegawczy</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag9\" data-check-id=\"tag9\"> <span><em>cierpliwi</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag10\" data-check-id=\"tag10\"> <span><em>poważani</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag11\" data-check-id=\"tag11\"> <span><em>bezszelestni</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tag12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tag12\" data-check-id=\"tag12\"> <span><em>wojownicy</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank0\" data-check-id=\"tagblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"wpisz własne\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank1\" data-check-id=\"tagblank1\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank1\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"wpisz własne\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"tagblank2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"tagblank2\" data-check-id=\"tagblank2\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:tagblank2\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"wpisz własne\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"exc0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"exc0\" data-check-id=\"exc0\"> <span><em>wyjątkowi</em> (wymaga Bohaterów do Końca)</span></label></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">Instynkt</h3>\n<p>Wybierz 1.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>Kłócić się, skakać sobie do gardeł i chować urazy</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>Trzymać się tradycji i zabobonów</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>Folgować niskim popędom</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>Panoszyć się nad innymi</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>Podejmować niepotrzebne ryzyko</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>Przeciągać strunę</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"wpisz własne\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">Cena</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>Wybierz 1.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"crew-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Lojalność</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-0\" title=\"Lojalność 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Lojalność 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-1\" title=\"Lojalność 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Lojalność 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-loyalty-2\" title=\"Lojalność 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Lojalność 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>Wspólna hulanka</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>Publiczne uznanie i szacunek, honory</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>Ryzyko, które podejmujesz, by im pomóc</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost3\" data-check-id=\"cost3\"> <span>Zwycięstwa nad godnymi wrogami</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost4\" data-check-id=\"cost4\"> <span>Bogactwo zdobyte dla siebie lub Stonetop</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"crew:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"wpisz własne\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"inventory\">Inwentarz</h3>\n<p>3 ◇ lub mniej to lekkie obciążenie; 4–6 ◇ to normalne obciążenie; 7–9 ◇ to ciężkie obciążenie.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-inventory\"><li>◇ <strong>Toporek</strong>, żelazny (<em>ręka</em>, <em>miotany</em>, x przebijający)</li><li>◇ <strong>Włócznia</strong>, żelazna (<em>blisko</em>, <em>miotana</em>, x przebijająca)</li><li>◇ <strong>Łuk i żelazne strzały</strong> (<em>niedaleko</em>, x przebijający, ○ mało strzał, ○ brak strzał)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Tarcza</strong> (+1 pancerza, +1 Gotowości przy 7+ przy Bronieniu)</li><li>◇◇ <strong>Grube skóry</strong> (1 pancerza, <em>ciepłe</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Płaszcz</strong> (<em>ciepły</em>)</li><li>◇ <strong>Zapasy</strong> (4+Dobrobyt użyć na członka drużyny)</li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-a-\"><span class=\"track-label\">Zapasy</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" title=\"Użycie 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-0\" aria-label=\"Użycie 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" title=\"Użycie 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-1\" aria-label=\"Użycie 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" title=\"Użycie 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-2\" aria-label=\"Użycie 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" title=\"Użycie 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-3\" aria-label=\"Użycie 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" title=\"Użycie 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-4\" aria-label=\"Użycie 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" title=\"Użycie 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-5\" aria-label=\"Użycie 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" title=\"Użycie 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-6\" aria-label=\"Użycie 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" title=\"Użycie 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-a-7\" aria-label=\"Użycie 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-b-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" title=\"Użycie 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-0\" aria-label=\"Użycie 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" title=\"Użycie 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-1\" aria-label=\"Użycie 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" title=\"Użycie 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-2\" aria-label=\"Użycie 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" title=\"Użycie 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-3\" aria-label=\"Użycie 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" title=\"Użycie 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-4\" aria-label=\"Użycie 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" title=\"Użycie 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-5\" aria-label=\"Użycie 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" title=\"Użycie 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-6\" aria-label=\"Użycie 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" title=\"Użycie 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" data-check-id=\"crew-supplies-b-7\" aria-label=\"Użycie 8\"></label></span></div><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"crew-supplies-c-\"><span class=\"track-label\"></span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" title=\"Użycie 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"crew-supplies-c-0\" data